 ### Classic Meshing
-A mesh generation technique where each voxel face is generated individually, resulting in higher vertex and index counts than greedy meshing [S4, unofficial]. Functions such as `addBackFace`, `addFrontFace`, etc., take a single voxel coordinate and append vertices and indices to buffers [S4, unofficial]. Choose it for straightforward implementation when performance optimization is secondary to simplicity.
